+    /**
+     * Rebuilds the natural-order variable list from the previous one and the pending changes: the variables before the
+     * first change keep their rows, the rest are renumbered in one pass - O(n + k log k) for k changes, where sorting
+     * every variable again was O(n log n) walking a tree.
